WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.201
First launch on Linux.

2
00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:05.667
Pick a model: bitcode lists what this computer already serves.

3
00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:09.810
Memory needs are shown before you choose.

4
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.688
Open a project folder.

5
00:00:11.688 --> 00:00:14.623
Start from a suggestion, or type your own request.

6
00:00:14.623 --> 00:00:25.087
Reading the project needs no approval. Changes and commands do.

7
00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:32.433
The answer stays in this chat, on this computer.
